{"w":["2026-10-12","2026-10-18"],"built":"2026-10-12T03:23Z","pending":140,"N":["","Musashi NZ describes Plant Protein as a \"vegan friendly formula\".","Kellogg's product page states \"Suitable for vegans\"; the NZ page lists the same ingredients.","Blue Frog's product page for the porridge pockets says \"100% vegan\".","Remedy: \"Kombucha, Sodaly and Switchel are all vegan-friendly.\"","Farrah's FAQ: all its wraps and tortillas, except Garlic Butter Wraps, are suitable for vegetarians and vegans.","Open Food Facts lists the Vegan label for Dolmio Extra Italian Herb pasta sauce.","Chelsea FAQ: nearly all its sugars and syrups suit vegans; the only exception is Honey Maple Flavoured Syrup.","Bluebird's NZ FAQ lists Bluebird Ready Salted (Originals, Thick Cut and Thinly Cut) as suitable for vegans.","Bluebird's NZ FAQ (maker of Copper Kettle) lists Copper Kettle Sea Salt as suitable for vegans.","Woolworths NZ pack claim says vegan, but emulsifier 471 (source unstated) is listed; check first.","Pringles' Minis BBQ product page states \"Suitable for vegans and vegetarians\".","Vitasoy's site lists Soy Milky Regular as suitable for vegetarians and vegans.","New World labels PopCorners Sweet & Salty 130g \"Vegan friendly\".","PETA Australia's accidentally vegan list includes Arnott's Gingernut biscuits.","PETA Australia's accidentally vegan list includes Sour Patch Kids.","Bluebird's NZ FAQ (NZ maker of Doritos) lists Doritos Original corn chips as suitable for vegans.","Woolworths NZ pack claim lists \"Vegan; Halal\"; ingredients are lentils, vegetables, oil and spices.","Ceres Organics' product page lists Vegan among its dietary attributes; ingredients are black beans and water.","Mingle's product page shows a \"Vegan Friendly\" badge; ingredients are spices and salt.","Mingle's product page shows a \"Vegan Friendly\" badge.","Ceres Organics' product page lists \"Vegetarian, Vegan, Plant Based\".","Ceres Organics' product page lists Vegan among its dietary attributes; ingredients are chickpeas and water.","Barker's product page shows a Vegan dietary badge; ingredients are fruit, acacia gum, citrus fibre, flavour and acai.","Barker's product page shows a Vegan dietary badge for this fruit puree.","PETA Australia lists Oreo Classic as accidentally vegan, but Oreo's own FAQ calls it lacto-vegetarian (may contain milk), not vegan.","PETA Australia lists Oreo Chocolate as accidentally vegan, but Oreo's own FAQ calls it lacto-vegetarian (may contain milk), not vegan."],"S":["Woolworths label","Musashi (manufacturer)","Kellogg's (manufacturer)","Blue Frog (manufacturer)","Remedy (manufacturer)","Farrah's (manufacturer)","Open Food Facts","Chelsea (manufacturer)","Bluebird (manufacturer)","Woolworths NZ listing (pack claim)","Pringles (manufacturer)","Vitasoy (manufacturer)","New World","PETA Australia","Ceres Organics (manufacturer)","Mingle (manufacturer)","Barker's (manufacturer)"],"U":["","https://nz.musashi.com/products/plant-protein","https://www.kelloggs.com.au/en_AU/products/just-right-original.html","https://bluefrogbreakfast.co.nz/products/vanilla-bean-chia-seed-porridge-copy-1","https://www.remedydrinks.com/blogs/news/are-remedy-drinks-vegan","https://www.farrahs.co.nz/faqs","https://world.openfoodfacts.org/product/9310012039556/dolmio-extra-pasta-sauce-italian-herb","https://www.chelsea.co.nz/about-sugar/faqs/","https://www.bluebird.co.nz/faqs","https://www.pringles.com/au/products/multipack-minis/pringles-minis-BBQ-95g.html","https://soy.com.au/product/soy-milky-regular/","https://www.newworld.co.nz/shop/product/5327924_ea_000nw","https://www.peta.org.au/living/accidentally-vegan/","https://ceres.co.nz/products/organic-black-beans-case-x-12-400g","https://www.mingleseasoning.com/products/japanese-curry","https://www.mingleseasoning.com/products/taco-mexican-fiesta","https://www.mingleseasoning.com/products/green-curry","https://www.mingleseasoning.com/products/satay-stir-fry","https://ceres.co.nz/products/11693-organic-red-